# Opening narration, before the tutorial fight.

narrator: Once upon a time, in a faraway land hidden within a forgotten realm... #id:97
narrator: There lived a very small rat with a very big heart. #id:98

join remi center

narrator: This is Remi, a small rat with an even bigger dream. #id:99
narrator: More than anything in the world, Remi dreamed of becoming the greatest dancer anyone had ever seen. #id:9a
narrator: Every day, he practiced his steps, improved his moves, and imagined the day he would finally perform in front of everyone. #id:9b
narrator: But there was only one small problem... Remi was, well... a rat. #id:9c
narrator: Still, Remi kept practicing, hoping that one day he would get the chance to prove himself. #id:9d
narrator: And now, that chance has finally arrived. #id:9e
narrator: You, my friend, will guide Remi on his journey and help him achieve his dream. #id:9f